	sourceCode: "title Disorientation\nauthor clickmazes\nhomepage https://www.clickmazes.com\nagain_interval 0.1\n\n========\nOBJECTS\n========\n\nBackground\nwhite\n\nWall\nblack\n\nAir\ntransparent\n\nplayerN\nred\n.000.\n.0.0.\n00000\n.000.\n.0.0.\n\nplayerE\nred\n..0..\n00000\n.00.0\n00000\n..0..\n\nplayerS\nred\n.0.0.\n.000.\n00000\n.0.0.\n.000.\n\nplayerW\nred\n..0..\n00000\n0.00.\n00000\n..0..\n\nghostN1 1\n#EEE\n.000.\n.0.0.\n00000\n.000.\n.0.0.\n\nghostE1 2\n#EEE\n..0..\n00000\n.00.0\n00000\n..0..\n\nghostS1 3\n#EEE\n.0.0.\n.000.\n00000\n.0.0.\n.000.\n\nghostW1 4\n#EEE\n..0..\n00000\n0.00.\n00000\n..0..\n\nghostN2\n#333\n.000.\n.0.0.\n00000\n.000.\n.0.0.\n\nghostE2\n#333\n..0..\n00000\n.00.0\n00000\n..0..\n\nghostS2\n#333\n.0.0.\n.000.\n00000\n.0.0.\n.000.\n\nghostW2\n#333\n..0..\n00000\n0.00.\n00000\n..0..\n\ncoin1\norange\n.....\n.000.\n.0.0.\n.000.\n.....\n\ncoin2\nbrown\n.....\n.000.\n.0.0.\n.000.\n.....\n\n=======\nLEGEND\n=======\n\n. = Background\n# = Wall\np = playerN\nq = playerN and wall\n\n* = coin1\n+ = coin2 and wall\n\n5 = ghostN2 and wall\n6 = ghostE2 and wall\n7 = ghostS2 and wall\n8 = ghostW2 and wall\n\nghostN = ghostN1 or ghostN2\nghostE = ghostE1 or ghostE2\nghostW = ghostW1 or ghostW2\nghostS = ghostS1 or ghostS2\nghost1 = ghostN1 or ghostE1 or ghostS1 or ghostW1\nghost2 = ghostN2 or ghostE2 or ghostS2 or ghostW2\nghost  = ghost1 or ghost2\n\nplayer = playerN or playerE or playerS or playerW\ncoin   = coin1 or coin2\n\n=======\nSOUNDS\n=======\n\nendlevel 35598103\nsfx0 68434705 (ghost)\nsfx1 20734107 (bump)\nsfx2 53410900 (coin)\n\n================\nCOLLISIONLAYERS\n================\n\nBackground\nWall Air\nghost coin\nplayer\n\n======\nRULES\n======\n[ no wall no air ] -> [ air ]\n \nup    [ stationary playerS ] -> [ > playerS ]\ndown  [ stationary playerN ] -> [ > playerN ] \nleft  [ stationary playerE ] -> [ > playerE ]\nright [ stationary playerW ] -> [ > playerW ] \n\n[ > player wall | air no ghost ] -> [ player wall | air ] \n[ > player air | wall no ghost ] -> [ player air | wall ] \n\n[ stationary player ] -> cancel sfx1\n\n(=== engine applies movement ===) \n\nlate [ player coin ] -> [ player ] sfx2\n\nlate [ player no playerN ghostN ] -> [ playerN ghostN ] sfx0\nlate [ player no playerE ghostE ] -> [ playerE ghostE ] sfx0\nlate [ player no playerS ghostS ] -> [ playerS ghostS ] sfx0\nlate [ player no playerW ghostW ] -> [ playerW ghostW ] sfx0\nlate [ player ghost ]             -> [ player ] sfx0\n\nlate up    [ playerS air | air ] -> [ playerS air | air ] again\nlate down  [ playerN air | air ] -> [ playerN air | air ] again\nlate left  [ playerE air | air ] -> [ playerE air | air ] again\nlate right [ playerW air | air ] -> [ playerW air | air ] again\n\nlate up    [ playerS wall | wall ] -> [ playerS wall | wall ] again\nlate down  [ playerN wall | wall ] -> [ playerN wall | wall ] again\nlate left  [ playerE wall | wall ] -> [ playerE wall | wall ] again\nlate right [ playerW wall | wall ] -> [ playerW wall | wall ] again\n\n==============\nWINCONDITIONS\n==============\n\nno coin\n\n=======\nLEVELS\n=======\n\nMessage Collect all the gold coins\n\n(#7#+###7#\n#.*.5##+#\n52.*..6##\n+.1.7*#q#\n7*.4+.+.#\n#.*.1..#+\n#7####*6#\n##8.5##+#\n6###+####)\n\n.3.*...3.\n.#+#1..*.\n16#+##2..\n*#5#3+.p.\n3+#8*#*#.\n.#+#5##.*\n.3....+2.\n..4#1..*.\n2...*....\n\n\nMessage Thanks for playing! :)",
