	sourceCode: "title Turning Older\nauthor Pastimeshark\nhomepage https://pastimeshark.itch.io\n\n========\nOBJECTS\n========\n\nBackground\nwhite \n\nWall\nblack\n\nAir\ntransparent\n\nplayer\ntransparent\n\nturnOld @\ngrey white black\n.000.\n01210\n01220\n01110\n.000.\n\nplayerN\nred\n.000.\n.0.0.\n00000\n.000.\n.0.0.\n\nplayerE\nred\n..0..\n00000\n.00.0\n00000\n..0..\n\nplayerS\nred\n.0.0.\n.000.\n00000\n.0.0.\n.000.\n\n(playerW\nred\n..0..\n00000\n0.00.\n00000\n..0..)\n\nghostN1 A\n#CCC\n.000.\n.0.0.\n00000\n.000.\n.0.0.\n\nghostE1 B\n#CCC\n..0..\n00000\n.00.0\n00000\n..0..\n\nghostS1 C\n#CCC\n.0.0.\n.000.\n00000\n.0.0.\n.000.\n\nghostW1 D\n#CCC\n..0..\n00000\n0.00.\n00000\n..0..\n\nghostN2 1\n#555\n.000.\n.0.0.\n00000\n.000.\n.0.0.\n\nghostE2 2\n#555\n..0..\n00000\n.00.0\n00000\n..0..\n\nghostS2 3\n#555\n.0.0.\n.000.\n00000\n.0.0.\n.000.\n\nghostW2 4\nblack\n..0..\n00000\n0.00.\n00000\n..0..\n\ncoin1 O\norange\n.....\n.000.\n.0.0.\n.000.\n.....\n\ncoin2 +\n#CCC\n.....\n.000.\n.0.0.\n.000.\n.....\n\n(I didn't name the sprites)\n\n=======\nLEGEND\n=======\n\n. = Background\n# = Wall\nP = player and playerE\npeople = playerN or playerE or playerS\nghosts = ghostN2 or ghostE2 or ghostS2\ntargets = ghostN1 or ghostE1 or ghostS1 or ghostW1 or coin2 \nbeings = people or ghosts\npushable = ghosts or coin1\n\n=======\nSOUNDS\n=======\n\nplayer move 1208907\npushable move 23810507\nsfx0 87357901\nsfx1 15874302\nsfx2 44314905\nrestart 55781903\nendgame 52706305\n\n================\nCOLLISIONLAYERS\n================\n\nBackground\nair\ntargets, turnOld\npeople, ghosts, wall, coin1, ghostW2\nplayer\n\n======\nRULES\n======\n\n[> player people] -> [> player > people]\n(player rotates but is still controllable)\n[> people | pushable] -> [> people | > pushable]\n[> pushable | pushable] -> [> pushable | > pushable]\n(multipush)\n\nlate [playerS turnOld] -> [ghostW2 turnOld] sfx1\nlate [playerE turnOld] -> [playerS turnOld] sfx0\nlate [playerN turnOld] -> [playerE turnOld] sfx0\n\nlate [no air ghostS2 turnOld] -> [air ghostW2 turnOld] sfx1\nlate [no air ghostE2 turnOld] -> [air ghostS2 turnOld] sfx0\nlate [no air ghostN2 turnOld] -> [air ghostE2 turnOld] sfx0\n(spin until final state, prevent multiple turns in one trigger)\n\nlate [no air ghostN1 ghostN2] -> [air ghostN1 ghostN2] sfx2\nlate [no air ghostE1 ghostE2] -> [air ghostE1 ghostE2] sfx2\nlate [no air ghostS1 ghostS2] -> [air ghostS1 ghostS2] sfx2\nlate [no air ghostW1 ghostW2] -> [air ghostW1 ghostW2] sfx2\nlate [no air ghostN1 playerN] -> [air ghostN1 playerN] sfx2\nlate [no air ghostE1 playerE] -> [air ghostE1 playerE] sfx2\nlate [no air ghostS1 playerS] -> [air ghostS1 playerS] sfx2\nlate [no air coin1 coin2] -> [air coin1 coin2] sfx2\n(check multiple targets types by putting air on them when they're satisfied)\n\nlate [air ghostN1 no ghostN2 no playerN] -> [no air ghostN1]\nlate [air ghostE1 no ghostE2 no playerE] -> [no air ghostE1]\nlate [air ghostS1 no ghostS2 no playerS] -> [no air ghostS1]\nlate [air no coin1 coin2] -> [no air coin2]\n(remove air when target is unsatisfied)\n\nlate [air no ghosts turnOld] -> [no air turnOld]\nlate [player no ghosts] -> []\nlate [people] -> [player people]\n(reset)\n\n==============\nWINCONDITIONS\n==============\nall targets on air\n\n=======\nLEVELS\n=======\n#########\n####..###\n#.#.+OC.#\n#...@1#.#\n#.#.P.B.#\n#########\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(h)\n\n\n",
